  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Italian steak crackles on the grill like a summer romance, each charred edge hinting at smoky, savory bliss. Rosemary, garlic, and bright lemon rub into the meat, filling every bite with bold, herb-packed flavor. Instead of wine, balsamic vinegar and rich beef broth soak into the steak, while a drizzle of extra virgin olive oil seals in all those mouthwatering juices. Serve your italian steak with blistered cherry tomatoes and peppery arugula tossed in garlic kissed olive oil, and every tender bite will feel like a trip to a Tuscan hillside at sunset.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-italian-steak\">Why You’ll Love This italian steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-italian-steak\">How to Make Italian Steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-italian-steak\">Pro Tips for Making Italian Steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-italian-steak\">How to Serve this italian steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-italian-steak\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This italian steak</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It’s incredibly juicy and flavorful, making every bite a delight.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Simple ingredients create an authentic Italian experience at home.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for impressing guests or enjoying a cozy dinner.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick to prepare, so you can savor more time with loved ones.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7864\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7864\" data-servings=\"2\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-r